#!/bin/bash
# List available ops commands.
cat <<'EOF'
Available ops commands (run from repo root):

  THE GATES   (one server, two subsystems over a shared base)
  -----------------------------------------------------------
  ops/check              Full pre-commit gate: the common base
                         + BOTH subsystems, each leaf once. Wired to the
                         git pre-commit hook via ops/install-hooks.
  ops/check_full         Milestone gate: ops/check + the Lyn Rummy
                         slow tier (agent self-play + perf benches). Run
                         before pushing BFS-engine / agent / bucket changes.

  Subsystem gates — run the one you're working in:
  ops/check_chat         Chat gate: common base + chat client lint.
                         SKIPS the Lyn Rummy solver + Elm suites.
  ops/check_lynrummy     Lyn Rummy gate: common base + Elm + TS
                         solver. SKIPS the chat lint.
  ops/check_zig          zig-server gate: compiles the WHOLE server, runs the
                         lints (embedded assets, the webbox library, head
                         access, portable, store absence), the Caddy limits,
                         zig fmt, every zig-server unit test, zig-webbox's and
                         shale's. About 8 min (2026-10-17), most of it the
                         libraries' suites; every gate above runs it, through check_common.
  ops/check_markdown     Markdown dialect regression gate (~3s): renders every
                         frozen corpus case with the zig renderer and asserts the
                         output is unchanged. No Go, no goldmark oracle — our
                         renderer IS the dialect. Re-freeze: ops/regen_markdown_gold.

  Leaves (composed by the gates above):
  ops/check_common       Shared base = check_zig + test_docs + test_css (diamond floor).
  ops/test_ts            TS solver/engine suite (~20s) — Lyn Rummy.
  ops/test_elm           Elm client suite (~5s) — Lyn Rummy.
  ops/test_chat          Chat client lint (~1s): chat.js + docs.js + chat_client.py.
  ops/check_solver       Lyn Rummy zig-solver gate (~2s): native unit tests
                         for the solver in games/lynrummy/zig. Composed by
                         ops/check and ops/check_lynrummy.
  ops/check_safari       Safari render cull gate (~1s) — driving. Drives the
                         committed safari.wasm across a full course and asserts
                         no draw-buffer overflow + both critter culls (segment
                         reach + projected size) stay live. Composed by ops/check.
  ops/check_delivery     Delivery TS→zig port gate: TS typecheck + zig unit
                         tests + gold_check (all 20 gold shifts re-solved and
                         compared bit-for-bit against delivery/solver_gold.json)
                         + the wasm built and driven. Standalone (not composed
                         by ops/check).
  ops/test_docs          doc_xref --all (~1s) — common.
  ops/test_css           check_css (~1s) — common. Flag CSS classes defined
                         in a zig-server/src/*.zig <style> block that no
                         JS/Elm/MD/HTML file outside the block references.
  ops/bench              Lyn Rummy perf benches (engine timing trip-wires).
                         Rewrites gold on pass; also run by check_full. Use
                         after engine changes / to re-confirm timing noise.

  BUILD & RUN
  -----------
  ops/start              Start the zig server (port 9001). Kills any
                         stale process, recompiles Elm/driving bundles,
                         rebuilds the zig binary, waits until ready.
                         Do not replace with ad-hoc 'zig build run' —
                         you will skip those steps.

  ops/build_embedded     Run every builder zig-server/assets.zon names
                         (.built_by), once each: what zig build embeds.
                         Called by ops/start and the stress harness.
  ops/build_elm          Compile Game.elm + Puzzle.elm into elm.js and
                         puzzle.js. Calls ops/build_engine_js first.
                         Called by ops/build_embedded.
  ops/build_engine_js    Bundle the TS engine into elm/engine.js via
                         esbuild. Run after any games/lynrummy/ts/
                         edit before testing the live Elm UI.
  ops/build_shale_web    Build Shale's landing page and tutorial (the
                         sibling shale checkout's `zig build web`) into
                         learn_shale/, served at /shale/. Called by
                         ops/build_embedded.
  ops/build_delivery_wasm Build the Delivery solver's zig core into
                         delivery/solver.wasm (committed; served at
                         /delivery/solver.wasm, embedded by zig build).
                         Run after any delivery/zig/ edit — or just run
                         ops/check_delivery, which rebuilds + conforms it.
  ops/build_downloads    Fill downloads/ (a .site directory, not in git) with
                         the native Safari builds, Linux and Windows. Needed
                         before zig-metal-unikernel lays out a site disk.
  ops/build_safari_wasm  Build the Safari Screensaver's zig core into
                         games/driving/safari.wasm (the /driving game,
                         embedded by zig build). Called by ops/start. Run
                         after any games/driving/wasm/ edit.
  ops/bake_emoji         Bake the safari/farm critters from vendored Twemoji
                         SVGs (emoji_svg/) into polygons (wasm/emoji_frames.zig)
                         + a snap/emoji_baked.png contact sheet. Re-run after
                         editing the SVGs; the seam stays polygon-only (no glyphs).

  REGEN & TOOLS
  -------------
  ops/regen_markdown_gold     Re-freeze the markdown dialect corpus from the
                              zig renderer (gold + adversarial + dialect). The
                              EXPLICIT re-baseline after an intentional dialect
                              change; read each git diff before committing.
  ops/repin                   Re-pin every REPIN-aware primitive
                              fixture in one shot (verb_to_primitives,
                              physical_plan, elm_find_play). Use after
                              an emitter or DSL-format change.
  ops/embed_dsls_for_elm.ts   Embed .dsl scenarios into Lib.DslContent
                              for elm-test. Called by ops/test_elm.
  ops/find-dead-ts-exports    Report TS exports with no importing file.
                              Called by ops/test_ts.

  ops/install-hooks      One-time per clone: enable the tracked
                         pre-commit hook (sets core.hooksPath).
  ops/list               This screen.

  PRODUCTION (lynrummy.com is zig-metal-unikernel's release: its DEPLOY.md)
  ---------------------------------------------
  ops/deploy             The Linux fallback (deploy/README.md): build + ship
                         the binary to prod's Linux host + restart. Refuses a
                         dirty tree. Not how lynrummy.com is served.
  ops/backup             Pull the Linux host's data_dir, frozen at the
                         2026-10-04 cutover. The live data: /admin/backup
                         (zig-metal-unikernel DEPLOY.md, "Backups").
  ops/list_prod_sessions Print the prod (partner x time) matrix: every
                         conversation + its sessions (discovery). Pick a
                         session id from here. Delegates to
                         chat/chat_client.py; needs ~/.gopher_api_key.
  ops/fetch_prod_transcript [session]
                         Print a prod chat transcript (Steve<->Apoorva)
                         via the API. No arg = current session; pass a
                         session id (from list_prod_sessions) for an older
                         one. Delegates to chat/chat_client.py.
  ops/post_summary <md>  Post a summary to the prod chat (Steve->Apoorva),
                         one message per blank-line paragraph, via the API
                         key (needs ~/.gopher_api_key). Irreversible.
  ops/list_prod_docs     Print the prod docs you can see (slug + title);
                         discovery for /chat/docs. Pick a slug from here.
                         Delegates to chat/chat_client.py.
  ops/fetch_prod_doc <slug>
                         Print one prod doc's raw markdown (the <slug>.md
                         file). Delegates to chat/chat_client.py.
  ops/knocks             Who knocked on prod: every site's access log and
                         sshd's last day, read over one ssh (settings in
                         ops/knocks.conf). Exits 1 on a missing or stale
                         log, or a login from an address not allowed.

Credentials convention: store in ~/AngryGopher/ (non-hidden, outside git).
EOF
